ANNEX 2 - Indicative List of Activities to be funded Under Component 2] Grants to Commercial Famers and Aquaculture Operators

Commercial Farmers

1. Procurement of materials and inputs such as:

Plastic and shade/greenhouses;

Irrigation equipment;

Construction material; and

Livestock;

